{
  "id": "section-insanity-table",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-insanity-table:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "insanity table (d6)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,22,42]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-insanity-table:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1 Paranoia. When you meet helpful people, you may not accept\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,42,103]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-insanity-table:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "their Food or healing.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,103,126]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-insanity-table:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2 Eating Disorder. You require 1 Food every 3 boxes.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,126,179]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-insanity-table:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "3\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,179,181]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-insanity-table:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Absent Mindedness . Every time you need a material\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,181,232]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-insanity-table:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "component for a ritual or a tool for a task, excluding weapons,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,232,296]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-insanity-table:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "roll d6. On a 1, that tool or object is unavailable. If you have a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,296,363]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-insanity-table:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Safe House in play, you left that item at the Safe House. If you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,363,428]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-insanity-table:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have no Safe House in play, the item is lost.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,428,474]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-insanity-table:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "4 Phobic. You have -1 on all rolls made to avoid losing Sanity or\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,474,540]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-insanity-table:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to resist Fear effects of any kind.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,540,576]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-insanity-table:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "5 Overconfidence. You may not make an Escape roll unless you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,576,637]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-insanity-table:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "are down to just 1 or 2 Life points.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,637,674]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-insanity-table:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6 Shaky. Your maximum Sanity is permanently lowered by 1.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[34,674,732]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    34
  ]
}
